      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 4.A — Putting it together",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Evaluate \\( \\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi} \\sin x\\,dx \\).</p><p>An antiderivative of \\( \\sin x \\) is \\( -\\cos x \\). By Part II,</p>\\[ \\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin x\\,dx=\\big[-\\cos x\\big]_0^{\\pi}=(-\\cos\\pi)-(-\\cos 0)=1+1=2. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Fundamental Theorem of Calculus",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p><strong>Part I:</strong> If \\( F(x)=\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt \\), then \\( F'(x)=f(x) \\).<br>\n          <strong>Part II:</strong> \\( \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\) where \\( F'=f \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "FTC Part I",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt = f(x) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "FTC Part II",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Net change",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\int_a^b F'(x)\\,dx = F(b)-F(a) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Chain rule form",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_a^{g(x)}\\!f(t)\\,dt = f(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)",
              "ar": null
            },
            "wide": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Evaluate \\( \\int_1^4 2x\\,dx \\).</p>\\[ F(x)=x^2,\\quad F(4)-F(1)=16-1=15. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find \\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\cos t\\,dt \\).</p>\\[ \\cos(x^2)\\cdot 2x = 2x\\cos(x^2). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "figure",
        "caption": {
          "en": "Accumulation function \\(g(x) = \\int_0^x f(t)\\,dt\\) measuring net area under \\(f(t)\\), illustrating the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus \\(g'(x) = f(x)\\).",
          "ar": null
        },
        "figure": {
